{"unit_id":"tag:042T:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是概形（scheme），并设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>上的代数空间（algebraic space）。假设<MATH_0004>是 fppf 覆盖（fppf covering），覆盖<MATH_0005>。则存在加细（refinement）<MATH_0006>，它加细<MATH_0007>，且是 fppf 覆盖（fppf covering），使得每个<MATH_0008>都是概形（scheme）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖"},{"source_term":"refinement","target_term":"加细"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基或覆盖中的概形；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"被覆盖的空间；待批准。"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖","context":"给定与加细后的覆盖；待批准。"},{"source_term":"refinement","target_term":"加细","context":"覆盖的加细；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:042T:proof","translation":"略。提示：对每个<MATH_0001>选取概形（scheme）<MATH_0002>及满射（surjective）的平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>。然后检验<MATH_0004>是 fppf 覆盖（fppf covering）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"覆盖的源；待批准。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"覆盖态射的性质；待批准。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"覆盖态射的性质；待批准。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"所选择的态射；待批准。"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖","context":"构造所得的覆盖；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0469:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是 fppf 覆盖（fppf covering），由<MATH_0003>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）构成。则层（sheaves）的映射（map）\n<MATH_0004>\n是满射（surjective）的。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基概形；待批准。"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖","context":"给定的覆盖；待批准。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"构成覆盖的空间；待批准。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"所考虑的层映射；待批准。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"覆盖诱导的映射；待批准。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"层映射的性质；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
